// Name :
"P1125762966" "Alysonde"
// ProfessionString :
"P3069048011" "The Huntress"
// DescriptionString :
"P2620078305" "Once a young explorer, Marissa Sorensen was well-known amongst the scientific community for discoveries relating the the relationship between the gods of the various pantheons and a strange location from which they drew their power. One day, Marissa herself discovered this location and became the Huntress, Alysonde. She is renowned among the heroes of the world for her selflessness, but her history as an explorer has left her with many enemies."
// LocationString :
"P3624779534" "Whereabouts Unknown"
// HelloString :
"P982586182" "You are getting closer... I can sense it now. I only hope... that I can last long enough... for you to find me."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1335634271" "Hello? Hello... I can't... establish the... Hello?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3416987124" "I have been freed, {HeroName}, and for that I will be eternally grateful. It is my hope that we can one day meet again under more auspicious circumstances, and should I ever need the assistance of one with immense courage and talent, I will call upon you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3301382660" "Forgive... my intrusion, but I see that I must find another. I cannot ask you to bear this burden, {HeroName}. You already carry the weigh of many troubles upon you..."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P937123101" "I am sorry, {HeroName}. I should not... have bothered you... Only someone with Security Level {Level}... will be able to help me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P856364347" ""
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2589749654" "I... don't know if you can help me..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HelloPage Text :
"P2272148921" "Hello? Hello... oh! {HeroName}... I... I know you....<br><br>Please... forgive this intrusion, {HeroName}. If I... if I had any choice, I would not... speak to you in this way. This psychic link, though... it is... all I have. I've been captured... I... I don't know who. I don't... know... where I am. Please... I need you... I need help... I have no other choice. This is all the power I have left... I am alone here in the darkness, and without your aid, I am certain I will die."
// Answer Text :
"P1041527398" "What? What is going on? Who are you?"
// Page WhoIsThis Text :
"P1808407627" "I... I am <color RoyalBlue>Alysonde, the Huntress</color>. Please, {HeroName}, forgive me... I am in pain and I did not think of the... effect... my linking would have. I... I am... an incarnation of the spirit that drives the natural world... though I was once mortal. Years ago... I was an explorer and classical archaeologist... my focus... was in antiquities relating to the gods of many pantheons. During the course of my investigations I found it... found where the power came from... and when I found it, it blessed me... and made me what I now am. <br><br>The rest of my story... it is not important now. But, I will say that many... very many... were jealous of what I became. The blessing... had made me powerful and ageless... and though I have lived my life in an effort to use that power well... there were those who believed that my blessing should have been theirs. And... there are still others... who were made to pay for their crimes... villains who sought to destroy and to kill without need... who have felt my wrath.<br><br>It could be any of them... indeed, I cannot say who... but someone has finally exacted their vengeance."
// Answer Text :
"P3677234372" "I have heard of you, Huntress. Why have you chosen me?"
// Page WhyMe Text :
"P943969330" "I... I have not chosen you, my friend... though from what I know of you... I am grateful you have heard my plea. My psychic link... it is the last power available to me... but it has no direction. I believe that you were chosen because... well, I would say you were in the right place... at the right time.<br><br>I... I cannot escape myself. My wings have been pierced... my arms and my legs are bound in chains that I cannot break... and even if I could escape this place, without my weapons, I would not get far. My enemies... have surely noticed my disappearance... and should any of them find me in this state... they would surely exact their merciless vengeance.<br><br>My time... it is likely very short... you are the first person to whom my connection has been established... you are the only one I have power left to reach... you must be the one to free me... I need you, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P597389624" "How can I help?"
// Page WhatSheWants Text :
"P1323022580" "I still do not know who has imprisoned me... I do not know if my weapons are close... I do not know if they intend on keeping me alive or ending this swiftly. Right now, all I know is that you... you can find out all these things.<br><br>The only lead I can offer is that you visit my lair... it is there I was attacked... it is there where I was taken. It will have a record of those events... it will show us what we need to know... so that I might be found. So... {HeroName}, if you are still willing to offer your aid, I shall show you the location of my lair. Within, you shall find my security system.... It is marked by an ancient glyph and is capable of storing the visions seen by the animal spirits who watch over my halls.<br><br>Find this glyph... and when you have it... we shall see what happened. I can only hope... that it will guide us in the right direction."
// Answer Text :
"P2156783619" "I'll do all that I can to help you, Alysonde."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

